```

- `P4-06-front-before.png` — at rest: zones < blocks < cards although the zone keys (`zz`, `zzz`)
  sort after every card key; `card-0002`/`card-0003` share `a1`, the later one is on top.
- `P4-06-front-after.png` — after one `reorder` (`card-0001`: `0` → `a3`, inverse `a3` → `0`): the
  green card is on top of the other cards and stays in the note-card layer (zones and blocks unchanged).
- `P4-06-reload-after.png` — after a reload the stored keys reproduce the order: the canvas pixels
  equal `P4-06-front-after.png`; the only 54 differing pixels (x 1103–1109, y 706–716) are the HUD
  frame counter (1 vs 2 rendered frames). A second front after the reload builds no operation.
- Edge cases checked in the browser: a store with an invalid key and an unknown id loads the
  scene defaults without an error; a second front on the top card is a no-op.

